{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short Blackjack game with a twist !</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3615940?t=1771421445","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3615940?t=1771421445","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615940/504b94a5aebc68924b63d3895a2880f76038b67b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771421445","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615940/504b94a5aebc68924b63d3895a2880f76038b67b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771421445","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Mature content : Extreme violence, use of weapons, suicide, murder."},"detailed_description":"<h1>Don't Push Your Luck</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this atmospheric <strong>card</strong> game : </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play rounds of deadly <strong>Blackjack !\u00a0</strong>try to get as close to <strong>21</strong> with your cards to win a round !\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you win a round you survive till the next one. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However if you lose it... You must try your luck with a loaded <strong>revolver</strong> in a true <strong>Russian Roulette</strong> style !!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615940/extras/d9f7476166bd6b428b4c9e41ed9036c2.poster.avif?t=1771421445\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615940/extras/d9f7476166bd6b428b4c9e41ed9036c2.webm?t=1771421445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615940/extras/d9f7476166bd6b428b4c9e41ed9036c2.mp4?t=1771421445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>Kill or be Killed</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you play your cards right, you <strong>might</strong> live to see a new day...<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615940/extras/48116117c4c0684d995e1002ac09b8f8.poster.avif?t=1771421445\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615940/extras/48116117c4c0684d995e1002ac09b8f8.webm?t=1771421445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615940/extras/48116117c4c0684d995e1002ac09b8f8.mp4?t=1771421445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short Blackjack game with a twist !</p>","developers":["TahaStudios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615940/7d9144ed3e0a01b632a7accf677f25799da59964/header.jpg?t=1771421445","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3615940/856327/54a9a667dd87e9a1ddbac7a9701f09c9bfa22214/1750453084/dash_av1.mpd?t=1743100934","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3615940/856327/54a9a667dd87e9a1ddbac7a9701f09c9bfa22214/1750453084/dash_h264.mpd?t=1743100934","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3615940/856327/54a9a667dd87e9a1ddbac7a9701f09c9bfa22214/1750453084/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1743100934","id":257117703,"name":"Game Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257117703/20a736445d8f4c37ab1b4557d52e270f95d6d94b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743100934"}],"name